# .skillprohibit — prohibited terms for this PUBLIC repo.
#
# Copy this file to `.skillprohibit` (which is .gitignored) and add your real
# terms there. The check-prohibited hook reads `.skillprohibit` and blocks any
# staged diff line OR commit message that matches — files AND messages.
#
# One `grep -iE` (case-insensitive extended regex) pattern per line.
# `#` comments and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Put internal/vendor codenames, ticket-board prefixes, internal hosts, and
# legacy product names here. Keep generic CLI words (e.g. a plain "dry-run"
# flag) OUT — match only the vendor/internal forms.
#
# Examples (replace with your real tokens in the gitignored .skillprohibit):
#   <internal-project-codename>
#   <vendor-bot-name>
#   <jira-board-prefix>-[0-9]
#   <internal-host>\.example\.net
#   <legacy-company-name>
